    "updated_at": "2026-08-06T11:19:53Z",
    "body": "Ohhh, you're right.\n\n**Argument for sticking with the current spec:** If this were an auto popover, it would be downgraded to hint, and the unrelated auto would stay open.\n\n**Argument for changing the behaviour to align with the test:** This is a dialog, not a hint.\n\nNote that dialogs are almost always opened via a click, which would close the unrelated auto popover anyway.\n\nI think changing the spec is the right move here. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#hide-popovers-until is only called by dialogs. I'd change that to follow the same logic that light dismiss clicks do, and update light dismiss to also call \"hide popovers until\".",
