    "created_at": "2026-08-06T13:09:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-06T13:10:32Z",
    "body": "I *think* I agree that this should be changed so that the auto popover closes if a *modal* dialog opens. But it depends how messy the spec / implementation gets because this is very edge case. I also think that non-modal dialogs potentially *shouldn't* close the other popover.",
